INSERT INTO `projects` VALUES (1,'Stuttgart School. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We received an order to produce a set of pictures of the school concept from the Ippolito Fleitz Group from Stuttgart. The halls of the building are quite spacious and glass walls give an opportunity to enjoy a beautiful view during the breaks between classes. The structure that covers the courtyard','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Stuttgart School','<p>We received an order to produce a set of pictures of the school concept from the Ippolito Fleitz Group from Stuttgart. The halls of the building are quite spacious and glass walls give an opportunity to enjoy a beautiful view during the breaks between classes. The structure that covers the courtyard contains solar panels that produce additional energy for the needs of the establishment.&nbsp;</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architecture: Ippolito Fleitz Group</li>\n<li>Location: Stuttgart, Deutschland</li>\n<li>January 2020</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"title\":\"Stuttgart School. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"link\":\"stuttgart_school\\/461_04-min.jpg\"},{\"type\":\"img\",\"title\":\"Stuttgart School. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"link\":\"stuttgart_school\\/461_3-min.jpg\"}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"title\":\"Stuttgart School. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"link\":\"stuttgart_school\\/461_2-min.jpg\"},{\"type\":\"img\",\"title\":\"Stuttgart School. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"link\":\"stuttgart_school\\/461_1-min.jpg\"}]]',NULL,'2025-06-25 16:10:58'),(2,'Artex. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We have been inspired by the beautiful kitchen Poliform Artex while working on the wonderful project of Mesmetric studio. Working on animation projects is always interesting because sometimes they can evoke more emotions, tell some small story or show a different perspective of the project, somethin','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Artex','<p>We have been inspired by the beautiful kitchen Poliform Artex while working on the wonderful project of Mesmetric studio. Working on animation projects is always interesting because sometimes they can evoke more emotions, tell some small story or show a different perspective of the project, something, that a static picture can\'t.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Design: Mesmetric</li>\n<li>Location: Warsaw, Poland</li>\n<li>November 2019</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"title\":\"Artex. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"link\":\"artex\\/454_1-min.jpg\"},{\"type\":\"video\",\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"links\":[{\"link\":\"artex\\/454_3-NOAUDIO.webm\",\"mime\":\"video\\/webm\"}]}]]',NULL,'2025-06-24 13:21:35'),(4,'Loft. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Our task within this project was to develop the concept of the minimalistic loft of a small apartment in a high-rise. Here we used reasonably priced, simple, and efficient materials, leaving a lot of free space in the room. We wanted to achieve a sense of orderliness in all elements of the interior ','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Loft','<p>Our task within this project was to develop the concept of the minimalistic loft of a small apartment in a high-rise. Here we used reasonably priced, simple, and efficient materials, leaving a lot of free space in the room. We wanted to achieve a sense of orderliness in all elements of the interior and a feeling of a large space while mixing rough materials of brick and concrete with neatly painted walls and new wood.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Private client</li>\n<li>Design: Terodesign</li>\n<li>August 2019</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"loft/447_3-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Loft. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1357},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"loft/447_2-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Loft. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1357},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"loft/447_1-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Loft. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1357}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"loft/447_6-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Loft. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1536,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"loft/447_5-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Loft. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1357,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"loft/447_4-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Loft. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1357}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(5,'Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign','This project was created for an Indonesian app development company Insvire. The building featured in this project consists of 3 floors:\n\n- The lobby, kitchen, and meeting room are located on the first floor\n- The second floor houses the division and coworking areas\n- The third floor contains the rel','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, office','Insvire','<p>This project was created for an Indonesian app development company Insvire. The building featured in this project consists of 3 floors:</p>\n<p>- The lobby, kitchen, and meeting room are located on the first floor<br />- The second floor houses the division and coworking areas<br />- The third floor contains the relaxation area</p>','<ul>\n<li>Client: Insvire company</li>\n<li>Location: Padalarang, Indonesia</li>\n<li>Design: Terodesign</li>\n<li>July 2019</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"insvire/446_4-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":1358,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"insvire/446_5-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"insvire/446_6-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":1357,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"insvire/446_3-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":1358,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"insvire/446_2-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":1358,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"insvire/446_9-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"insvire/446_1-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":1440,\"height\":1920}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"insvire/446_8-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":1440,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"insvire/446_7-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":1440,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"insvire/446_13-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":960,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"insvire/446_12-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":960,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"insvire/446_11-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":960,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"insvire/446_10-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":960,\"height\":1920}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(6,'Forest Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We received a request for the visualization of this project in 2018, however, for some reason, the project wasn\'t started then. Nevertheless, we really liked the architecture of this building and we decided to make several visualizations of this project just for fun. We wanted to place this building','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Forest Villa','<p>We received a request for the visualization of this project in 2018, however, for some reason, the project wasn\'t started then. Nevertheless, we really liked the architecture of this building and we decided to make several visualizations of this project just for fun. We wanted to place this building in some unusual environment and we decided to show it as a country house in the forest.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Client: Wolfgang D Bock</li>\n<li>Location: M&uuml;nchen, Deutschland</li>\n<li>April 2020</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"forest_villa/414_3-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Forest Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"forest_villa/414_4-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Forest Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"forest_villa/414_2-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Forest Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"forest_villa/414_1-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Forest Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(7,'Hrudhyam. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','These particular visualizations were created for a commercial property building in Gandhinagar, India. It was designed by Nishith Builders and Consultants (NCON). The building itself contains a shopping arcade offering showrooms and shops with more ceiling height, a corporate office with integrated ','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Hrudhyam','<p>These particular visualizations were created for a commercial property building in Gandhinagar, India. It was designed by Nishith Builders and Consultants (NCON). The building itself contains a shopping arcade offering showrooms and shops with more ceiling height, a corporate office with integrated small to medium workplace, and 4 Star hotel with 96 rooms with an infinity swimming pool.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architecture: NCON</li>\n<li>Location: Gandhinagar, India</li>\n<li>January 2019</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"hrudhyam/428_1-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Hrudhyam. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1154},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"hrudhyam/428_2-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Hrudhyam. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":864},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"hrudhyam/428_3-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Hrudhyam. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":850}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(9,'Wasserkunst. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','„Wasserkunst“ is situated in Lübeck between Ratzeburger Allee in the west and Wakenitz in the east in St. Jürgen district. This building presents the elegance of architectural decisions and functionality. The surroundings of this house are displayed with a beautiful river passing nearby and a scenic','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Wasserkunst','<p>&bdquo;Wasserkunst&ldquo; is situated in L&uuml;beck between Ratzeburger Allee in the west and Wakenitz in the east in St. J&uuml;rgen district. This building presents the elegance of architectural decisions and functionality. The surroundings of this house are displayed with a beautiful river passing nearby and a scenic area.</p>\n<div id=\"gtx-trans\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 5px; top: -12px;\">\n<div class=\"gtx-trans-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>','<ul>\n<li>Architects: KPW Architekten</li>\n<li>Location: L&uuml;beck, Germany</li>\n<li>October 2019</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"video\",\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"links\":[{\"link\":\"wasserkunst\\/393_1.webm\",\"mime\":\"video\\/webm\"}]},{\"type\":\"img\",\"title\":\"Wasserkunst. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"link\":\"wasserkunst\\/393-1-min2.jpg\"},{\"type\":\"img\",\"title\":\"Wasserkunst. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"link\":\"wasserkunst\\/393-5-min2.