interior, cgi, render, rendering, design, cgartist, architecture, interiordesign, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Barbierstrasse','<p>This building is located in M&uuml;nchen, Deutschland, and it is made in classic contemporary architecture. The house contains 5 apartments and underground parking. Each apartment has an open space in the form of a private garden, and one or two balconies in the penthouse on the top floor.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Design: Riedel-Immobilien</li>\n<li>Location: Barbierstra&szlig;e 2, M&uuml;nchen, Deutschland</li>\n<li>May 2018</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"barbierstrasse/389_3-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Barbierstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1081},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"barbierstrasse/389_2-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Barbierstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1440},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"barbierstrasse/389_1-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Barbierstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1440}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(13,'Nymphenburg. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This building is situated in Munich, Germany, in one of the best residential areas in the city. Our building is oriented to the south, which means that all blocks are bathed in sunlight. High windows let the sunlight fill the interiors, which emphasizes the high-quality luxurious materials of the in','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, interior, cgi, render, rendering, design, cgartist, architecture, interiordesign, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Nymphenburg','<p>This building is situated in Munich, Germany, in one of the best residential areas in the city. Our building is oriented to the south, which means that all blocks are bathed in sunlight. High windows let the sunlight fill the interiors, which emphasizes the high-quality luxurious materials of the interiors.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Client: Riedel-Immobilien</li>\n<li>Location: M&uuml;nchen, Deutschland</li>\n<li>May 2018</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/13\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"nymphenburg/386_1-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Nymphenburg. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"nymphenburg/386_2-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Nymphenburg. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"nymphenburg/386_4-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Nymphenburg. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":960},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"nymphenburg/386_3-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Nymphenburg. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1435}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(14,'Voigtstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This is a hotel building, which is situated in a calm area in the city center of Berlin, Germany. There are three large apartments on the top floor with terraces for additional space and a magnificent view of Berlin. The apartments also have their own sauna and a cozy fireplace.','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, interior, cgi, render, rendering, design, cgartist, architecture, interiordesign, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Voigtstrasse','<p>This is a hotel building, which is situated in a calm area in the city center of Berlin, Germany. There are three large apartments on the top floor with terraces for additional space and a magnificent view of Berlin. The apartments also have their own sauna and a cozy fireplace.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architects: Kniepkamp Architekten</li>\n<li>Client: Bewocon</li>\n<li>Location: Berlin, Germany</li>\n<li>November 2018</li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"voigtstrasse/382_opt-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Voigtstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1512,\"height\":1920}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(18,'Tibbaut. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Sometimes even minor things make us absolutely fall in love with the architecture, in the latest work of Raúl Sánchez we saw the excellency in shape and form and we wanted to give you our take on it in our renders. This work shows how combining just a few colors can grow into marvelous architecture.','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Tibbaut','<p>Sometimes even minor things make us absolutely fall in love with the architecture, in the latest work of Ra&uacute;l S&aacute;nchez we saw the excellency in shape and form and we wanted to give you our take on it in our renders. This work shows how combining just a few colors can grow into marvelous architecture.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architects: Ra&uacute;l S&aacute;nchez</li>\n<li>Location: El Raval, Barcelona, Spain</li>\n<li>May 2018</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/18\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"tibbaut/366_4-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Tibbaut. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1344,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"tibbaut/366_3-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Tibbaut. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1344,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"tibbaut/366_6-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Tibbaut. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1344,\"height\":1920}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"tibbaut/366_1-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Tibbaut. 3D visualization