ure is changed completely by those, and many other factors. This project started when we saw the amazing work of architects Josep Camps and Olga Felip. We tried to show that the same things may appear in a new light, even if you look at them from the same angle</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architects: Josep Camps, Olga Felip</li>\n<li>Location: Barcelona, Spain</li>\n<li>April 2018</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/24\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"sifera_house/352-04N.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":2300,\"width\":2300},{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"sifera_house/352-02N.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":2300,\"width\":2300},{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"sifera_house/352-05.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":2300,\"width\":3050}],[{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"sifera_house/352-01N.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":2300,\"width\":2300},{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"sifera_house/352-03N.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":1920,\"width\":1920},{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"sifera_house/352-06n.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":2300,\"width\":2300}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(25,'Delta Tielt. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Colors are important instruments of the artist in architecture, it\'s a true mastery to show a clean pallet without oversaturating the main concept. In our opinion architect Steven De Jaeghere managed to do just that with his DELTA project. We got inspired when we saw photos by Stijn Vereeken and dec','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Delta Tielt','<p>Colors are important instruments of the artist in architecture, it\'s a true mastery to show a clean pallet without oversaturating the main concept. In our opinion architect Steven De Jaeghere managed to do just that with his DELTA project. We got inspired when we saw photos by Stijn Vereeken and decided to make several exterior visualizations and recreate this beautiful architecture.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architects: DE JAEGHERE Architectuuratelier</li>\n<li>Inspiration: Stijn Vereeken</li>\n<li>Location: 8700, Belgium</li>\n<li>May 2018</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/25\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"delta_tielt/350-4-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Delta Tielt. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1440},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"delta_tielt/350-6-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Delta Tielt. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"delta_tielt/350-2-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Delta Tielt. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1440}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"delta_tielt/350-3-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Delta Tielt. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1440},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"delta_tielt/350-5-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Delta Tielt. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"delta_tielt/350-1-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Delta Tielt. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1440}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(27,'Christopher Street. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We were contacted by Asthetiquegroup to create a visualization for the reconstruction of one of the houses in New York. The new interior and exterior design were created by Asthetiquegroup. We tried to select the best camera angles and lighting in order to give the viewers the most prominent feeling','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exteri