 an incredible project by Prague architects Jan Holna and Petr &Scaron;ediv&yacute; (http://www.dam.cz), so we decided to create a visualization for it. Beautiful minimalistic architectural forms and contrasting materials of the building make it stand out from the surroundings and draw attention.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architects: Jan Holna, Petr &Scaron;ediv&yacute; (DAM.architekti)</li>\n<li>Location: Prague, Czech Republic</li>\n<li>November 2018</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/28\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"the_blox/331_0-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"The BLOX. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1382},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"the_blox/331_3-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"The BLOX. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1920}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"the_blox/331_4-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"The BLOX. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1322,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"the_blox/331_1-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"The BLOX. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1081}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"the_blox/331_05-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"The BLOX. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1440,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"the_blox/331_06-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"The BLOX. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1440}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(29,'Office Building Kennedy-Wisconsin. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Our team decided to make a beautiful visualization based on photos by Marcos Mendizabal. We were inspired by the unusual design of the building and made sure to recreate it in accordance with the reference material as closely as possible. Our objective was to not exactly replicate the surrounding en','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Kennedy Wisconsin','<p>Our team decided to make a beautiful visualization based on photos by Marcos Mendizabal. We were inspired by the unusual design of the building and made sure to recreate it in accordance with the reference material as closely as possible. Our objective was to not exactly replicate the surrounding environment but to bring some of our own ideas and creativity into the visualization process.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architects: Alemparte-Morelli y Asociados Arquitectos</li>\n<li>Location: Vitacura, RM, Chile</li>\n<li>Oсtober 2018</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"kennedy_wisconsin/329_1-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Office Building Kennedy-Wisconsin. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1320,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"kennedy_wisconsin/329_3-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Office Building Kennedy-Wisconsin. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1320,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"kennedy_wisconsin/329_2-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Office Building Kennedy-Wisconsin. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1320,\"height\":1920}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(33,'Apartamento en Malaga. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We received a request from a private client to create a set of interior visualizations for an apartment in Malaga, Spain. We had to create the design as well as visualizations. The requirements for the design were simple - it has to be minimalistic, ergonomic, and yet functional and cozy.','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','