esigner, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Olsztyn','<p>We were contacted by a famous Polish studio called Tamizo to create a set of interior visualizations. Our task within this project was to convey a minimalistic mood, to emphasize colors and luxurious materials. Furthermore, we also had to select the required decorations and the best camera angles in order to show all the beautiful design solutions of the house.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Design: Tamizo studio</li>\n<li>Location: Poland, Olsztyn</li>\n<li>August 2016</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/34\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"olsztyn/277_01-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1371},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"olsztyn/277_02-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1357,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"olsztyn/277_04-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1357,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"olsztyn/277_03-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1357,\"height\":1920}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"olsztyn/277_07-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1357},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"olsztyn/277_08-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1357},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"olsztyn/277_06-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1357},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"olsztyn/277_05-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1357,\"height\":1920}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(35,'Horkogo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We created this set of interior visualizations of the apartment from Kyiv, Ukraine. Besides the visualizations, we also took part in creating the design of this project together with Leks architects. The main task within this project was to preserve the original classic interior style, make it comfo','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Horkogo','<p>We created this set of interior visualizations of the apartment from Kyiv, Ukraine. Besides the visualizations, we also took part in creating the design of this project together with Leks architects. The main task within this project was to preserve the original classic interior style, make it comfortable and cozy, and yet, add some modern furniture elements.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Design: Leks architects &amp; Terodesign</li>\n<li>Location: Hor\'kogo str. Kyiv, Ukraine</li>\n<li>August 2017</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/35\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"horkogo/256_02-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Horkogo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1904,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"horkogo/256_01-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Horkogo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1456}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"horkogo/256_03-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Horkogo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1421,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"horkogo/256_05-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Horkogo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1421,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"horkogo/256_04-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Horkogo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1421,\"height\":1920}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"hor