nufacture, cgi, render, visualization, terodesign, exterior, garden, concept, fireplace, kitchen, equipment, accessories, product visualization','Conmoto','<p>This is a set of images we created for Conmoto projects. We had to visualize different garden equipment and accessories. This was quite an interesting experience for us, as we had to pay enough attention to individual pieces of furniture to show them as attractively as possible.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','<ul>\n<li>Manufacture: Conmoto</li>\n<li>March 2021</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/43\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"conmoto/493_opt-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Conmoto. Product 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1008},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"conmoto/494_2-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Conmoto. Product 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1440},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"conmoto/494_4-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Conmoto. Product 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1357,\"height\":1920}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"conmoto/572_3-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Conmoto. Product 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1591,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"conmoto/572_5-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Conmoto. Product 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1498,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"conmoto/572_4-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Conmoto. Product 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1478},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"conmoto/572_2-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Conmoto. Product 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1668,\"height\":1920}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"conmoto/572_1-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Conmoto. Product 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1402,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"