: London, United Kingdom<br />May 2021<br /><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/45\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></p>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"the_highview_park/481_5-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"The Highview Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1546},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"the_highview_park/481_3-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"The Highview Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":872}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"the_highview_park/481_1-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"The Highview Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1079},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"the_highview_park/481_2-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"The Highview Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1029},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"the_highview_park/481_4-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"The Highview Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1440,\"height\":1920}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(46,'Tabbertstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','The Tabbertstraße 9 project is located at the very embankment of the river Spree in Berlin, Germany. The idea of this complex is to build a facility comfortable for work and leisure with a beautiful view of the opposite side of the river. The embankment is covered with restaurants and cafes for thos','exterior, river, CGI, service 3D, architecture, architectural, visualization, concept, 3dsmax, coronarenderer, archvis, archviz, image','Tabbertstrasse','<p>The Tabbertstra&szlig;e 9 project is located at the very embankment of the river Spree in Berlin, Germany. The idea of this complex is to build a facility comfortable for work and leisure with a beautiful view of the opposite side of the river. The embankment is covered with restaurants and cafes for those who want to have dinner near the water after a hard-working day.</p>','<p>Client: Bewocon Berliner Wohnbau Consult GmbH<br />Location: Tabbertstra&szlig;e 9, 12459 Berlin, Germany<br />May 2021</p>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"tabbertstrasse/503_opt-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Tabbertstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1633,\"height\":1920}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(47,'Sailing Pavilion. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This Sailing Pavilion is situated on one of the coasts of Florida State in the USA. This building is going to serve as a multi-purpose community, event, education, and office space focused on the world of sailing. Everyone who is interested in water sports such as sailing, kayaking, swimming, etc. w','exterior, 3D visualization, visualization service, image, 3D service, agency, Visualizer, CG imagery, Architecture, storytelling, Visualization Agency, Rendering Agency, studio, Estate, marketing, visual, swimming, sailing, kayaking, water sport','Sailing Pavilion','<p>This Sailing Pavilion is situated on one of the coasts of Florida State in the USA. This building is going to serve as a multi-purpose community, event, education, and office space focused on the world of sailing. Everyone who is interested in water sports such as sailing, kayaking, swimming, etc. will be able to enjoy this place and find numerous ways to take a rest under the sun and feel a fresh breeze while surfing the water.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architecture: William Olmsted Antozzi Office Of Architecture &amp; Derek Pirozzi Design Workshop</li>\n<li>Location: 1717 Ken Thompson Pkwy, Sarasota, FL 34236, USA</li>\n<li>January 2021</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/47\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"sailing_pavilion/491-1-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Sailing Pavilion. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1066},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"sailing_pavilion/491-2-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Sailing Pavilion.