 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1536}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(51,'Ascona. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','The building is situated in Ascona, Via Ferrera 106. The inhabitants of this building will surely be comforted by the interior layouts, materials, and features, as well as the gorgeous view of the mountains. One of the most interesting features of this development is the inner courtyard dotted with ','exerior, Switzerland, cgi, 3d, visualization, terodesign, alps, architecture','Ascona','<p>The building is situated in Ascona, Via Ferrera 106. The inhabitants of this building will surely be comforted by the interior layouts, materials, and features, as well as the gorgeous view of the mountains. One of the most interesting features of this development is the inner courtyard dotted with varied greenery, which will allow spending your leisure time feeling embraced by nature.</p>','<div><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">Architecture:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"bold\">Garzoni SA</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sub-title\">Location: Via Ferrera 106, 6612 Ascona, Switzerland</div>\n<div class=\"sub-title\">\n<div><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">June 2020<br /><br /></span></span></div>\n</div>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"ascona/469_opt-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Ascona. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1920}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(54,'Ceresiana Palace. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio','Ceresiana Palace project is a renovation of an existing building located in Riva Antonio Caccia 1D in Lugano in Switzerland. The building once served various purposes. Now it is a beautiful residential complex with a lobby on the ground floor, exhibition space on the first floor, and luxurious apart','exterior, interior, livingroom, bedroom, Lugano, Switzerland, visualiztion, archviz, service 3d, architecture','Ceresiana Palace','<p>Ceresiana Palace project is a renovation of an existing building located in Riva Antonio Caccia 1D in Lugano in Switzerland. The building once served various purposes. Now it is a beautiful residential complex with a lobby on the ground floor, exhibition space on the first floor, and luxurious apartments above.</p>','<div class=\"sub-title\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">Architecture:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"bold\">Garzoni SA</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sub-title\">Location: Riva Antonio Caccia 1D, Lugano, Switzerland</div>\n<div class=\"sub-title\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">March 2021<br /><br /></span></span></div>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"ceresiana_palace/495_opt-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Ceresiana Palace. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1205}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(56,'Via San Gottardo. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio','This building is situated in the center of Lugano. The building has a rather interesting architecture compared to the surrounding buildings, which will definitely make it stand out among them. The building has a coplanar facade covered with small ceramic tiles, which provides the best solution for e','exterior, interior, photomontage, matching, lugano, swiss, visualization, 3d, render','Via San Gottardo','<p>This building is situated in the center of Lugano. The building has a rather interesting architecture compared to the surrounding buildings, which will definitely make it stand out among them. The building has a coplanar facade covered with small ceramic tiles, which provides the best solution for energy saving and noise insulation.</p>','<div class=\"sub-title\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">Architecture: </span><span class=\"bold\">Garzoni SA</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sub-title\">Location: Via Massagno 2, Lugano, Switzerland</div>\n<div class=\"sub-title\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">January 2021<br /><br /></span></span></div>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"via_san_gottardo/489_opt-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Via San Gottardo. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1407}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(57,'Sorengo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign Studio','This building is a multipurpose development placed in the center of Sorengo in Switzerland. It is a building on 3 levels above ground, where on the ground floor there is a covered parking space, on the first floor we have a Lidl grocery store and on the top floor, there is an administrative area for','Exterior, Visualization, Photomontage, 3D, Switzerland, Swiss, Sorengo, Archviz, Archvis, Render, Railclone, RealEstate','Sorengo','<p>This building is a multipurpose development placed in the center of Sorengo in Switzerland. It is a building on 3 levels above ground, where on the ground floor there is a covered parking space, on the first floor we have a Lidl grocery store and on the top floor, there is an administrative area for offices. The base of the building is designed in exposed concrete, while the upper part is covered with brown-colored perforated metal.</p>','<div class=\"sub-title\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">Architecture: </span><span class=\"bold\">Garzoni SA</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sub-title\">Location: Via Ponte Tresa 35, Sorengo, Switzerland</div>\n<div class=\"sub-title\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">January 2021<br /><br /></span></span></div>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"sorengo/479_-optim-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Sorengo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign Studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1200}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(59,'Roelckestrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This project was created for Frank Schiffer Architekten GMBH. It consists of 2 buildings which are situated on the Roelckestrasse and Lehderstrasse streets in Berlin. These 2 buildings are made in a similar design and form some sort of a \"gateway\" to Lehderstrasse street.','exterior, archviz, 3dvisualization, render, coronarenderer, 3dsmax, cgi, rendering, 3d service, 3d architecture','Roelckestrasse','<p>This project was created for Frank Schiffer Architekten GMBH. It consists of 2 buildings which are situated on the Roelckestrasse and Lehderstrasse streets in Berlin. These 2 buildings are made in a similar design and form some sort of a \"gateway\" to Lehderstrasse street.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architecture: Frank Schiffer Architekten GMBH</li>\n<li>Location: Berlin, Deutschland</li>\n<li>March 2022</li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"roelckestrasse/527_opt-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Roelckestrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1272}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(60,'Pauline. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio','This building is a reconstruction of the existing building from 1970. The prevailing materials of the building are concrete, brick, and wooden slats. The Interesting feature of the project is the long balcony with plant separations between the apartments, that goes along the building.','Exterior, architecture, visualization, realestate, marketing, service, reconstruction, archviz, render, 3d architecture, concept, cgi, 3dsmax','Pauline','<p>This building is a reconstruction of the existing building from 1970. The prevailing materials of the building are concrete, brick, and wooden slats. The Interesting feature of the project is the long balcony with plant separations between the apartments, that goes along the building.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architecture: Frank Schiffer Architekten GMBH</li>\n<li>Location: Berlin, Deutschland</li>\n<li>March 2022</li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"pauline/Ext-FULL_PF.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":1080,\"width\":2616}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(61,'Villa Casa Campana. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This set of images was created together with our partner IMOGENT for a client from sunny Spain. The villa is located in a hilly area surrounded by picturesque mountains which grants an incredible view and a feeling of space and freedom. The interiors are filled with luxurious furniture emphasized by','villa, interior, Spain villa, visualization, exterior, archviz, 3d design, minimalist villa, 3dsmax, 3d service, architecture visualization, 3d tour, cgi, 3d panorama','Casa Campana Villa','<p>This set of images was created together with our partner IMOGENT for a client from sunny Spain. The villa is located in a hilly area surrounded by picturesque mountains which grants an incredible view and a feeling of space and freedom. The interiors are filled with luxurious furniture emphasized by different high-end materials such as marble, stone, and wood. The large windows will always help to keep the interiors filled with warm sunlight during the day. In addition, there is no doubt that anyone would appreciate taking sunbathes near the pool area with such a wonderful view.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Design: IMOGENT &amp; Terodesign</li>\n<li>Location: La Nucia 03530, Alicante, Spain</li>\n<li>June 2022</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/61\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"title\":\"Villa Casa Campana. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"link\":\"casa_campana_villa\\/540_6-min.jpg\"},{\"type\":\"vr\",\"title\":\"iframe>\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/tero.design\\/public\\/360tours\\/CasaCampana%20UPD\\/index.htm\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"title\":\"Villa Casa Campana. 3D visualization service. Te