>September 2021</li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"wilson_st/507_02-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Wilson St. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":877},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"wilson_st/507_1-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Wilson St. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(63,'KBC project. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','In this project, we had to create an image of a townhouse in Melbourne, Australia. The image represents the high-quality materials of the building and it also possesses a variety of simple yet particular details. The neighborhood is also full of greenery, which will help the inhabitants to feel clos','exterior, terodesign, visualization, archviz, australian, rendering, render, 3d visualization, architecture','KBC','<p>In this project, we had to create an image of a townhouse in Melbourne, Australia. The image represents the high-quality materials of the building and it also possesses a variety of simple yet particular details. The neighborhood is also full of greenery, which will help the inhabitants to feel closer to nature even living in the suburbs of a megapolis.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Client: The Arctic Mirage</li>\n<li><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">Architecture</span></span>:<span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\"> ArchiSmart pty ltd</span></span></li>\n<li>Location: 113 Alfred Rd, Melton South VIC 3338, AU</li>\n<li>March 2022</li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"kbc/542_opt-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"KBC project. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1440}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(64,'Dendy St. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This building is located in Melbourne, Australia and we had to create a set of images to show the most interesting features of this property. The project possesses a vast range of high-quality exterior and interior materials. The contemporary and ergonomic design emphasizes the level of comfort and ','exterior, interior, 3dvisualization, archviz, coronarenderer, australian, 3d service, terodesign, marketing, Brighton, property, real estate','Dendy St','<p>This building is located in Melbourne, Australia and we had to create a set of images to show the most interesting features of this property. The project possesses a vast range of high-quality exterior and interior materials. The contemporary and ergonomic design emphasizes the level of comfort and feeling of coziness that this estate can provide.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Client: The Arctic Mirage</li>\n<li><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">Architecture</span></span>:<span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\"> MERRYLEES ARCHITECTURE</span></span></li>\n<li>Visualization: Terodesign</li>\n<li>Location: 52A Dendy St, Brighton VIC 3186, Australia</li>\n<li>May 2021</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/64\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"dendy_st/499_1-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Dendy St. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1334},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"dendy_st/499_4-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Dendy St. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1080,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"dendy_st/499_5-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Dendy St. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1440,\"height\":1920}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"dendy_st/499_2-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Dendy St. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":640},{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"dendy_st/499_an40.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":1920,\"width\":1440}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(65,'Carpenter. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This dwelling is located on the corner of Carpenter and Black Street in Brighton, Australia. The building looks modern and quite unique, especially when observing the design of the balconies, which are rather spacious and at the same time rather cozy. The flora of the area is rather diverse, while t','Exterior, visualization, 3d service, architecture, archviz, coronarenderer, terodesign, Brighton','Carpenter St','<p>This dwelling is located on the corner of Carpenter and Black Street in Brighton, Australia. The building looks modern and quite unique, especially when observing the design of the balconies, which are rather spacious and at the same time rather cozy. The flora of the area is rather diverse, while the plants on the facade are contained in one style which emphasizes the beauty of the architecture.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Client: The Arctic Mirage</li>\n<li><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">Architecture</span></span>:<span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\"> MERRYLEES ARCHITECTURE</span></span></li>\n<li>Location: 39 Carpenter St, Brighton VIC 3186, Australia</li>\n<li>March 2020</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/65\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"carpenter_st/468_1-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Carpenter. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":960},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"carpenter_st/468_4-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Carpenter. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1600}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"carpenter_st/468_3-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Carpenter. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1210},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"carpenter_st/468_2-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Carpenter. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studi