ualization, exterior visualization','SRM','<p>This project is a new 5-level building in the dense area of Moorabbin district in Melbourne. The ground floor of the building features a cozy cafe that welcomes visitors with a warm ambiance and delicious food and coffee. The apartments are filled with modern materials and high-quality furniture that are both stylish and functional.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Client: Studio Blonde</li>\n<li>Location: Melbourne, Australia</li>\n<li>February 2023</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/71\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"srm/567_1-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"SRM. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1658,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"srm/567_2-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"SRM. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1600},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"srm/567_3-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"SRM. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1408,\"height\":1920}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"srm/567_4-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"SRM. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1248},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"srm/567_5-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"SRM. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":875},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"srm/567_6-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"SRM. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1578,\"height\":1920}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(72,'Wolfratshausen. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio','This new building is situated in the Waldram district in Wolfratshausen which is located in the suburbs of Munich. This is a peaceful area with lots of greenery and primarily family houses. The building consists of 4 3-level houses with separate entrances and backyards.','exterior, exterior 3d, building 3d, building visualization, exterior visualization, render service, archviz studio, service 3d visualization, house 3d, house visualization','Wolfratshausen','<p>This new building is situated in the Waldram district in Wolfratshausen which is located in the suburbs of Munich. This is a peaceful area with lots of greenery and primarily family houses. The building consists of 4 houses with separate entrances and backyards.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architecture: Garche Immobilien</li>\n<li>Location: T&ouml;rringstra&szlig;e 24, 82515 Wolfratshausen, Germany</li>\n<li>April 2023</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/72\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"wolfratshausen/573-1-min2.jpg\",\"description\":\"Wolfratshausen. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1200},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"wolfratshausen/573-3_2-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Wolfratshausen. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1538,\"height\":1920}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(73,'Möckernstraße Office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This office is situated on the attic floor of the building on Möckernstraße Street in Berlin. The design of the space is rather minimalistic yet ergonomic and cozy. The office has many dormer and regular windows which allow it to fill in the space with lots of natural daylight. There is a mezzanine ','interior design, interior visualization, office visualization, office 3d visualization, office render, coronarenderer, office design','Mockernstrasse','<p>This office is situated on the attic floor of the building on M&ouml;ckernstra&szlig;e Street in Berlin. The design of the space is rather minimalistic yet ergonomic and cozy. The office has many dormer and regular windows which allow it to fill in the space with lots of natural daylight. There is a mezzanine area covered with wooden planks for privacy. A very interesting feature of this design is a central meeting room with blue walls and a big ceiling lamp.</p>','<u