Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1536}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"zhringen/570_5-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Zähringen. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1075},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"zhringen/570_3-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Zähringen. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1574,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"zhringen/570_2-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Zähringen. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1785,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"zhringen/570A_3.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":1920,\"width\":1080}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(81,'Salita Cuccarello. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We\'ve developed a 3D visualization for Garzoni SA, helping them showcase the attractive features of their real estate in Bioggio, Svizzera, Switzerland. Our project has assisted the company in capturing client attention and standing out effectively in the real estate market','','Salita Cuccarello','<p>We\'ve developed a 3D visualization for Garzoni SA, helping them showcase the attractive features of their real estate in Bioggio, Svizzera, Switzerland. Our project has assisted the company in capturing client attention and standing out effectively in the real estate market. The outcomes of our work have served as a compelling marketing tool for Garzoni SA.</p>','<ul>\n<li><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">Architecture: </span><span class=\"bold\">Garzoni SA</span></span></li>\n<li>Location: Bioggio, Svizzera, Switzerland</li>\n<li><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">July 2023</span></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/81\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"salita_cuccarello/576_01-min22.jpg\",\"description\":\"Salita Cuccarello. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"salita_cuccarello/576_03-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Salita Cuccarello. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":697},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"salita_cuccarello/576_02-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Salita Cuccarello. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":701}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(82,'ViaGerso. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Discover our latest 3D visualization project for Garzoni SA\'s modern multi-family building in Lugano. Seamlessly blending contemporary style with the city\'s charm, complemented by nice landscaping','exterior, lugano, ticino, switzerland, visualization, render, archviz, 3d service, architectural visualization, Svizzera','Via Gerso','<p>3D visualization project for Garzoni SA\'s multi-family building. Inspired by Lugano\'s architectural heritage, the design seamlessly marries modernity with the city\'s scenic charm. Complemented by thoughtfully landscaped surroundings, courtesy of the developer, this building promises to be a harmonious addition to the urban landscape. We\'re grateful for the opportunity to contribute to this collective vision.</p>','<ul>\n<li><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">Architecture: </span><span class=\"bold\">Garzoni SA</span></span></li>\n<li>Location: 6900 Lugano, Svizzera, Switzerland</li>\n<li><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">June 2023</span></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/82\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"via_gerso/583_2-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"ViaGerso. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1920},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"via_gerso/583_1-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"ViaGerso. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1882}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(83,'Villa Dacco. Animation. Terodesign','Experience understated luxury and comfort in our latest project: an animated interior set amidst the picturesque Swiss landscape of Collina d\'Oro. Nestled on a hilltop, this interior offers a panoramic view of Lake Lugano, seamlessly blending the beauty of nature with modern living. ','','Villa Dacco','<p>Experience understated luxury and comfort in our latest project: an animated interior set amidst the picturesque Swiss landscape of Collina d\'Oro. Nestled on a hilltop, this interior offers a panoramic view of Lake Lugano, seamlessly blending the beauty of nature with modern living. Our team\'s task was to evoke a sense of refined elegance and coziness through 3D visualization, capturing the essence of this living room space.</p>','<ul>\n<li><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">Architecture: </span><span class=\"bold\">Garzoni SA</span></span></li>\n<li>Location: Collina d\'Oro, Switzerland</li>\n<li><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">December 2023</span></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/83\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"villa_dacco/590-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Villa Dacco. Animation. Terodesign\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1613},{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"villa_dacco/5c_ud.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":1920,\"width\":1080}],[{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"villa_dacco/3c.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":1920,\"width\":1080},{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"villa_dacco/2C.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":1920,\"width\":1080},{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"villa_dacco/4c.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":1920,\"width\":1080},{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"villa_dacco/3c.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":1920,\"width\":1080}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(84,'AP1. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','House in Sarasota, Florida, USA by TWO Architects, LLC. 3D visualization','','AP1','<p>House in Sarasota, Florida, USA by <span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">TWO Architects, LLC</span></span></p>','<ul>\n<li><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">Architecture: TWO Architects, LLC</span></span></li>\n<li>Location: Sarasota, Florida, USA</li>\n<li>December 2023</li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"ap1/592_opt-min3.jpg\",\"description\":\"House in Sarasota, Florida, USA by TWO Architects, LLC\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1703}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(85,'Staufen im Breisgau. 3D visualization service. Terodesign','Staufen im Breisgau. 3D visualization service. Terodesign','','Staufen im Breisgau','<ul>\n<li>Client: Koch Wohnbau&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Architecture: Stollarchitekten</li>\n<li>Location: Staufen im Breisgau, Germany</li>\n<li>April 2023</li>\n</ul>','<ul>\n<li>Client: Koch Wohnbau&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Architecture: Stollarchitekten</li>\n<li>Location: Staufen im Breisgau, Germany</li>\n<li>April 2023</li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"staufen_im_breisgau/565_opt.jpg\",\"description\":\"Staufen im Breisgau. 3D visualization service. Terodesign\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1700}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(86,'NIAM-OOF. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio','We are pleased to share our latest work: a 3D visualization of a logistics center for NIAM and OOF companies, completed in a tight timeframe for our client OOF Group AB. The project, developed by the architectural firm Krook & Tjäder, is located along the highway near Arlanda, Sweden. ','logistic, terodesign, exterior, aerial view','NIAM-OOF','<p>We are pleased to share our latest work: a 3D visualization of a logistics center for NIAM and OOF companies, completed in a tight timeframe for our client OOF Group AB. The project, developed by the architectural firm Krook &amp; Tj&auml;der, is located along the highway near Arlanda, Sweden. This collaboration led to the successful realization of the project, which was highly appreciated by the client.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Client: OOF Group AB</li>\n<li>Architecture: Krook &amp; Tj&auml;der</li>\n<li>Location: Stockholm Arlanda, Sweden</li>\n<li>March 2024</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/86\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"niam-oof/594_1-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"NIAM-OOF. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1088},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"niam-oof/594_2-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"NIAM-OOF. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1470},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"niam-oof/594_3-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"NIAM-OOF. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1388}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(87,'Les Jardins d’Aden N°4. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','The project \"Les Jardins d’Aden N°4,\" located in the commune of Bernex, Geneva, is a luxury residential complex of 11 apartments, developed in collaboration with Linéa Architecture and Grisoni-Zaugg. These residences offer spacious interiors and high-quality finishes, situated in a picturesque green','exterior, interior, 3d visualization, render, service 3d, visuals','Les Jardins d’Aden N°4','<p>We are pleased to present our latest 3D visualization work for OAKS LANE SA. The project \"Les Jardins d&rsquo;Aden N&deg;4,\" located in the commune of Bernex, Geneva, is a luxury residential complex of 11 apartments, developed in collaboration with Lin&eacute;a Architecture and Grisoni-Zaugg. These residences offer spacious interiors and high-quality finishes, situated in a picturesque green area with convenient access to urban amenities.</p>\n<p>Our client highly appreciated the quality of our visuals and the adherence to project deadlines.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Client: OAKS LANE SA</li>\n<li>Location: Bernex, Switzerland</li>\n<li>December 2023</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/87\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"les_jardins_daden_n4/591_03-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Les Jardins d’Aden N°4. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1641},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"les_jardins_daden_n4/591_01-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Les Jardins d’Aden N°4. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":960}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"les_jardins_daden_n4/591_04-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Les Jardins d’Aden N°4. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1694},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"les_jardins_daden_n4/591_06-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Les Jardins d’Aden N°4. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1226},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"les_jardins_daden_n4/591_07-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Les Jardins d’Aden N°4. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1745}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"les_jardins_daden_n4/591_05-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Les Jardins d’Aden N°4. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1217},{\"type\":\"curtain\",\"direction\":\"\",\"first\":{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"les_jardins_daden_n4/591_01-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Les Jardins d’Aden N°4. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":960},\"last\":{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"les_jardins_daden_n4/591_02-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Les Jardins d’Aden N°4. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":960}}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"les_jardins_daden_n4/591_09-min.j