o highlight the investment benefits to future buyers.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Client: GSW Sigmaringen</li>\n<li>Location: Reutlingen, Germany</li>\n<li>April 2024</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/88\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"reutlingen/597_2-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Reutlingen. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":960},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"reutlingen/597_1-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Reutlingen. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1280}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(89,'Matterhornstraße. 3D visualization service by Terodesign','We are excited to showcase our work on the 3D visualization of a private housing complex in a tranquil and cozy neighborhood of Munich. The project was developed by Garche Immobilien. Our photorealistic images will be used in the marketing campaign for the sale of these houses.',', exterior, interior, cgi, render, visualization, 3dvisualization, archviz','Matterhornstrasse','<p>We are excited to showcase our work on the 3D visualization of a private housing complex in a tranquil and cozy neighborhood of Munich. The project was developed by Garche Immobilien. Our photorealistic images will be used in the marketing campaign for the sale of these houses.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architecture: Garche Immobilien</li>\n<li>Location: M&uuml;nchen, Germany</li>\n<li>May 2024</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/89\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"matterhornstrasse/598_02-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Matterhornstraße. 3D visualization service by Terodesign\",\"width\":1080,\"height\":1350},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"matterhornstrasse/598_09-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"Matterhornstraße. 3D visualization service by Terodesign\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":960}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"matterhornstrasse/598_04-m