ation of a residential house in Sarasota, Florida. ',', exterior, interior, 3d visualization, CGI service, florida 3d','HB1','<p>We are excited to present our collaborative project, developed in partnership with the architectural firm Two Architects LLC. Our goal was to create a 3D visualization of a residential house in Sarasota, Florida. Through this visualization, we aimed to convey a sense of comfort, tranquility, and relaxation. We believe we have successfully achieved this. What do you think?</p>','<ul>\n<li>Architecture: <span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">TWO Architects, LLC</span></span></li>\n<li>Location: Sarasota, Florida, USA</li>\n<li>August 2024</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/91\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"hb1/601_3-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"HB1. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1528},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"hb1/601_1-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"HB1. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1258},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"hb1/601_2-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"HB1. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1266}],[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"hb1/c5-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"HB1. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1075},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"hb1/c4-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"HB1. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1075},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"hb1/6-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"HB1. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1075},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"hb1/7-min.jpg\",\"description\":\"HB1. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":1920,\"height\":1920}]]',NULL,'2025-06-15 16:45:16'),(92,'Lofoten Prestige. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Experience the stunning Arctic beauty of Norway’s Lofoten Islands through our 3D visualizations. This project, showcasing rental homes for tourists, highlights our expertise in creating realistic, captivating imagery for developers. We bring unique locations to life, exceeding client expectations.',', terodesign, norway 3D visualization, exterior render, Arctic 3D, archviz','Lofoten Prestige','<p>Set against the stunning Arctic backdrop of Norway&rsquo;s Lofoten Islands, this project features homes designed for tourist rentals. Our mission was to create striking 3D visualizations for the developer&rsquo;s website, bringing the unique beauty of this location to life.<br />The real challenge lay in conveying the raw, untouched beauty of the Arctic environment. After unveiling our work, hearing the client say we had surpassed their expectations was the ultimate recognition of our efforts.</p>','<ul>\n<li>Clients: Jim Eide, Robert Heldal</li>\n<li>Architecture: Urbanhus</li>\n<li>Branding: Ole Storesund</li>\n<li>Website &amp; Project Coordination: <a href=\"https://adream.pl/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ADream</a></li>\n<li>Photos: Kuba Gurdak</li>\n<li>Location: Smorten, Norway</li>\n<li>October 2024</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tero.design/project/92\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Full Project</a></li>\n</ul>','[[{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"lofoten_prestige/605_4c_pf.jpg\",\"description\":\"Lofoten Prestige. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":2048,\"height\":1152},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"lofoten_prestige/605_12c_pf.jpg\",\"description\":\"Lofoten Prestige. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":2048,\"height\":1152}],[{\"type\":\"video\",\"links\":[{\"link\":\"lofoten_prestige/605_11c.webm\",\"mime\":\"video/webm\"}],\"height\":2304,\"width\":2072},{\"type\":\"img\",\"link\":\"lofoten_prestige/605_9c_pf.jpg\",\"description\":\"Lofoten Prestige. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio\",\"width\":2048,\"height\":1152}]