INSERT INTO `tbl_projects` VALUES (9,'Stuttgart School. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Let us kindly introduce one of the recent projects that we created within incredibly tight timeframes. We received an order to produce a set of pictures of the school concept from Ippolito Fleitz Group from Stuttgart. The halls of the building are quite s','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Stuttgart School','<p>Let us kindly introduce one of the recent projects that we created within incredibly tight timeframes. We received an order to produce a set of pictures of the school concept from Ippolito Fleitz Group from Stuttgart. The halls of the building are quite spacious and glass walls give an opportunity to enjoy a beautiful view during the breaks between classes. The area outside has large greenery zones. The structure that covers the courtyard contains solar panels that produce additional energy for the needs of the establishment. Working on this project was quite challenging, nevertheless, we are happy with the result.</p>','<ul><li>Architecture: Ippolito Fleitz Group</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign</li><li>Location: Stuttgart, Deutschland</li><li>January 2020</li></ul>','1600076970_861.jpg:*!Stuttgart School. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600077021_13.jpg:*!Stuttgart School. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600077039_151.jpg:*!Stuttgart School. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600077047_773.jpg:*!Stuttgart School. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600077055_802.jpg:*!Stuttgart School. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2'),(10,'Poliform Artex. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We have been inspired by the beautiful kitchen Poliform Artex while working on the wonderful project of Mesmetric studio. From now on we will try to make such kinds of animation projects as often as possible because sometimes they can evoke more emotions,','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Poliform Artex','<p>We have been inspired by the beautiful kitchen Poliform Artex while working on the wonderful project of Mesmetric studio. From now on we will try to make such kinds of animation projects as often as possible because sometimes they can evoke more emotions, tell some small story or show a different perspective of the project, something, that a static picture can\'t. We hope that you like it as much as we do!</p>','<ul><li>Private client</li><li>Design: Mesmetric</li><li>Location: Warsaw, Poland</li><li>November 2019</li></ul>','1600077768_489.jpg:*!Poliform Artex. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1601307629_362.mp4:*!Poliform Artex. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600077866_381.jpg:*!Poliform Artex. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2'),(7,'Penthouse in Tel Aviv. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This particular project is a result of a fruitful collaboration between Terodesign Studio and M3 Architects. We received a task from a client in Israel to create the conceptual design and produce a set of renders for his 460m2 Penthouse. The design was cr','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Penthouse in Tel Aviv','<p>This particular project is a result of a fruitful collaboration between Terodesign Studio and M3 Architects. We received a task from a client in Israel to create the conceptual design and produce a set of renders for his 460m2 Penthouse. The design was created for the living area, dining, kitchen, and terrace, and a set of renderings brought this design to life. This combination of luxurious materials and furniture will give a lasting feeling of comfort and calm, while the view on the Mediterranean nature from the terrace will encourage new adventures.</p>','<ul><li>Private client</li><li>Interior design: M3 Architects</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign</li><li>Location: Druyanov St 5, Tel Aviv-Yafo</li><li>July 2020</li></ul>','1600076427_788.jpg:*!Penthouse in Tel Aviv. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600076050_730.jpg:*!Penthouse in Tel Aviv. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600076096_331.jpg:*!Penthouse in Tel Aviv. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600076116_203.jpg:*!Penthouse in Tel Aviv. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600076133_0.jpg:*!Penthouse in Tel Aviv. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600076159_269.jpg:*!Penthouse in Tel Aviv. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600076182_219.jpg:*!Penthouse in Tel Aviv. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600076200_505.jpg:*!Penthouse in Tel Aviv. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600076223_903.jpg:*!Penthouse in Tel Aviv. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!5(())1600076234_390.jpg:*!Penthouse in Tel Aviv. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!5(())1600076251_671.jpg:*!Penthouse in Tel Aviv. 3d visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6'),(11,'Loft447. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Our task within this project was to develop the concept of the minimalistic loft of a small apartment in a high-riser. Here we used reasonably priced, simple, and efficient materials, leaving a lot of free space in the room. First of all, we wanted to ach','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Loft447','<p>Our task within this project was to develop the concept of the minimalistic loft of a small apartment in a high-riser. Here we used reasonably priced, simple, and efficient materials, leaving a lot of free space in the room. First of all, we wanted to achieve a sense of orderliness of all elements of the interior and a feeling of a large space, while mixing rough materials of brick and concrete with neatly painted walls and new wood. We are also looking forward to working on similar projects in the future!</p>','<ul><li>Private client</li><li>Location: Moskow, Russia</li><li>Design and visualization: Terodesign</li><li>August 2019</li></ul>','1600079929_270.jpg:*!Loft447. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600079946_237.jpg:*!Loft447. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600080109_846.jpg:*!Loft447. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600080100_135.jpg:*!Loft447. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600080165_278.jpg:*!Loft447. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600080175_976.jpg:*!Loft447. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3'),(12,'Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign','This project was created for an Indonesian app development company Insvire. We really enjoyed working on it, as the design is rather expressive. The deadline was quite tight, but our cohesive team was able to complete it on time. The building featured in ','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, office','Insvire company office','<p>This project was created for an Indonesian app development company Insvire. We really enjoyed working on it, as the design is rather expressive. The deadline was quite tight, but our cohesive team was able to complete it on time. The building featured in this project consists of 3 floors:</p><ul><li>The lobby, kitchen, and meeting room are located on the first floor</li><li>The second floor houses the division and coworking areas</li><li>The third floor contains the relaxation area</li></ul><p>The Insvire offices project was truly great to work on and we are looking forward to many more interesting collaborations in the future.</p>','<ul><li>Client: Insvire company</li><li>Location: Padalarang, Kabupaten Bandung Barat, Indonesia</li><li>Design: Terodesign</li><li>July 2019</li></ul>','1600085067_1.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign:*!1(())1600085135_720.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600085227_341.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600085252_377.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600086280_895.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600085535_920.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600085547_434.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600085559_407.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600085776_155.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600085787_949.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600085808_18.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600085854_625.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!5(())1600085883_796.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6(())1600085899_471.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6(())1600085926_514.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6(())1600086368_676.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!7(())1600086221_57.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!7(())1600086232_279.jpg:*!Insvire company office. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!7'),(15,'Forest Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This was an unusual project. We received a request for the visualization of this project in 2018, however, for some reason, the project wasn\'t started then. Nevertheless, we really liked the architecture of this building and we decided to make several vis','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Forest Villa','<p>This was an unusual project. We received a request for the visualization of this project in 2018, however, for some reason, the project wasn\'t started then. Nevertheless, we really liked the architecture of this building and we decided to make several visualizations of this project just for fun. We wanted to place this building in some unusual environment and we decided to show it as a country house in the forest. We really hope that we managed to convey the atmosphere of airiness and relaxation.</p>','<ul><li>Client: Wolfgang D Bock</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign</li><li>Location: München, Deutschland</li><li>April 2020</li></ul>','1600088988_547.jpg:*!Forest Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600089647_192.jpg:*!Forest Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600089727_840.jpg:*!Forest Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600089774_95.jpg:*!Forest Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600089781_807.jpg:*!Forest Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4'),(14,'Hrudhyam. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','These particular visualizations were created for a commercial property building in Gandhinagar, India. It was designed by Nishith Builders and Consultants (NCON). The building itself contains the shopping arcade offering showrooms and shops with more ceil','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Hrudhyam','<p>These particular visualizations were created for a commercial property building in Gandhinagar, India. It was designed by Nishith Builders and Consultants (NCON). The building itself contains the shopping arcade offering showrooms and shops with more ceiling height, corporate office with integrated small to the medium workplace, and 4 Star hotel with 96 rooms with an infinity swimming pool. We enjoyed working on this project very much as creating visualizations for such kind of architecture is always a pleasure. We are looking forward to creating more interesting visualizations like this in the future!</p>','<ul><li>Architecture: Nishith Builders and Consultants ( NCON )</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign</li><li>Location: Gandhinagar, India</li><li>January 2019</li></ul>','1600087254_37.jpg:*!Hrudhyam. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600088350_889.jpg:*!Hrudhyam. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600088372_293.jpg:*!Hrudhyam. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600088444_656.jpg:*!Hrudhyam. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600088410_701.jpg:*!Hrudhyam. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600088476_72.jpg:*!Hrudhyam. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600088486_723.jpg:*!Hrudhyam. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!5'),(18,'Big Box. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','One of our clients asked us to create a lobby interior visualization for the 18-floor office building in Salmabad, Bahrain. The architecture was designed by OAOA Architecture Associates. The building is situated near the highway to Saudi Arabia. The lands','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Big Box','<p>One of our clients asked us to create a lobby interior visualization for the 18-floor office building in Salmabad, Bahrain. The architecture was designed by OAOA Architecture Associates. The building is situated near the highway to Saudi Arabia. The landscape is mostly sandy with dunes and low vegetation, so the lobby has to welcome everyone with healing cool air and space. The materials that are used in interiors are mostly luxurious and represent the status of the company.</p>','<ul><li>Design: OAOA Architecture Associates</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Salmabad, Bahrain, Bahrain</li><li>January 2019</li></ul>','1600091249_644.jpg:*!Big Box. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600091265_625.jpg:*!Big Box. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600091278_651.jpg:*!Big Box. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1'),(19,'Wasserkunst. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','„Wasserkunst“ is situated in Lübeck between Ratzeburger Allee in the west and Wakenitz in the east in St. Jürgen district. There are 12 separate houses in this area, and this particular house has 3 floors. This building presents the elegance of architectu','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Wasserkunst','<p>„Wasserkunst“ is situated in Lübeck between Ratzeburger Allee in the west and Wakenitz in the east in St. Jürgen district. There are 12 separate houses in this area, and this particular house has 3 floors. This building presents the elegance of architectural decisions and functionality. The surroundings of this house are displayed with a beautiful river passing nearby and scenic area. This quiet and peaceful place will not leave you indifferent.</p>','<ul><li>Architects: KPW architekten</li><li>Client: Purerender</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign</li><li>Location: Lübeck, Germany</li><li>October 2019</li></ul>','1601304616_509.mp4:*!Wasserkunst. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())<div class=\"curtain curtain-h\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600682175_617.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600682182_1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>:*!:*!1(())1600092113_146.jpg:*!Wasserkunst. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600092132_181.jpg:*!Wasserkunst. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600682192_438.jpg:*!Wasserkunst. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2'),(17,'Villenkolonie II. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','The exclusive properties are located in Obermenzinger Villenkolonie II, one of the best residential areas in the north-west of Munich. In the year 1900 four villas were built in Obermenzing and Pasing according to the plans of such great architects as Ric','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Villenkolonie II','<p>The exclusive properties are located in Obermenzinger Villenkolonie II, one of the best residential areas in the north-west of Munich. In the year 1900 four villas were built in Obermenzing and Pasing according to the plans of such great architects as Richard Riemerschmid, Bernhard Borst, and August Exter. The beautiful green surroundings with well-kept historical buildings, modern multi-family complexes, large gardens, and a lot of old trees provide an extremely pleasant, privileged living. The new buildings fit harmoniously with this environment. Obermenzing is one of the most sought after residential areas in Munich. Here a high recreational value meets a family-friendly, grown infrastructure. The idyllic Würmgürtel presents itself as a natural oasis, the nearby Blutenburg Castle unfolds its historic charm in every season and conveys a very special feeling of life.</p>','<ul><li>Architects: PRO-BAU Baumanagement GmbH</li><li>Client: Riedel Immobilien</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Barystraße 81245 München</li><li>September 2018</li></ul>','1601307016_472.mp4:*!Villenkolonie II. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())<div class=\"curtain curtain-h\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600339015_20.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600339019_524.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>:*!:*!1'),(20,'Iconic Mosque. Creek Harbour. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Creating visualization for contests is always an interesting and challenging task, that inspires us on making more and more projects. This particular project was created within the design competition for Dubai Creek Harbour. This innovative and simple des','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, mosque, competition, emaar, dubai','Iconic Mosque. Creek Harbour','<p>Creating visualization for contests is always an interesting and challenging task, that inspires us on making more and more projects. This particular project was created within the design competition for Dubai Creek Harbour. This innovative and simple design represents the spirituality in it\'s best. Emaar’s vision for Dubai Creek Harbour is to create an urban, liveable city that respects the culture and climate of Dubai, while presenting a space where people can live, work, and play. We did our best for this contest and we hope that you enjoy the result as much as we do!</p>','<ul><li>Architects: Adam Associates</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Dubai, United Arab Emirates (UAE)</li><li>Date: May 2018</li></ul>','1600094311_798.jpg:*!Iconic Mosque. Creek Harbour. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600094329_307.jpg:*!Iconic Mosque. Creek Harbour. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600095980_669.jpg:*!Iconic Mosque. Creek Harbour. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600096054_782.jpg:*!Iconic Mosque. Creek Harbour. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2'),(21,'Barbierstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This visualization set was created for Riedel-Immobilien. The building is located in München, Deutschland, and it is made in classic contemporary architecture. The house contains 5 apartments and underground parking. Large glass facades and full-height wi','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, interior, cgi, render, rendering, design, cgartist, architecture, interiordesign, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Barbierstrasse','<p>This visualization set was created for Riedel-Immobilien. The building is located in München, Deutschland, and it is made in classic contemporary architecture. The house contains 5 apartments and underground parking. Large glass facades and full-height windows provide good lighting inside the apartment. Each apartment has an open space in the form of a private garden, one or two balconies in the penthouse on the top floor. Hope you enjoy this project!</p>','<ul><li>Design: Riedel-Immobilien</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Barbierstraße 2, München, Deutschland</li><li>May 2018</li></ul>','1601305752_965.mp4:*!Barbierstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600095254_155.jpg:*!Barbierstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600095289_222.jpg:*!Barbierstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600095354_723.jpg:*!Barbierstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600095326_965.jpg:*!Barbierstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600095339_837.jpg:*!Barbierstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600095310_265.jpg:*!Barbierstrasse. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())<div class=\"curtain curtain-h\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600336300_866.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600336306_646.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>:*!:*!4(())<div class=\"curtain curtain-h\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600337614_889.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600337617_577.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>:*!:*!4'),(22,'Nymphenburg. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Here we would like to present another project that we created for Riedel-Immobilien. This building is situated in Munich, Germany, in one of the best residential areas in the city. You may also find lots of squares, parks, and the most exciting thing - Ny','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, interior, cgi, render, rendering, design, cgartist, architecture, interiordesign, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Nymphenburg','<p>Here we would like to present another project that we created for Riedel-Immobilien. This building is situated in Munich, Germany, in one of the best residential areas in the city. You may also find lots of squares, parks, and the most exciting thing - Nymphenburg Palace there. Our building is oriented to the south, which means that all blocks are bathed in sunlight. High windows let the sunlight fill the interiors, that emphasizes high-quality luxurious materials of the interiors.</p>','<ul><li>Design: Riedel-Immobilien</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign</li><li>Location: München, Deutschland</li><li>May 2018</li></ul>','1600266925_587.jpg:*!Nymphenburg. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600268070_518.jpg:*!Nymphenburg. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600268081_674.jpg:*!Nymphenburg. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600096654_530.jpg:*!Nymphenburg. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())<iframe class=\"ku-embed\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen all