tuated in a calm area in the city center of Berlin, Germany. It is surrounded by picturesque green spaces such as Blankensteinpark or Lichtenberg City Park. There are three large apartments on the top floor with terraces for additional space and a magnificent view of Berlin. The apartments also have their own sauna and a cozy fireplace. These apartments will give you a warm feeling of home comfort!</p>','<ul><li>Architects: Kniepkamp-architekten</li><li>Client: BEWOCON Berliner Wohnbau Consult GmbH</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Berlin, Germany</li><li>November 2018</li></ul>','1600097068_634.jpg:*!Voigtstrasse 42. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600097100_173.jpg:*!Voigtstrasse 42. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600275075_559.jpg:*!Voigtstrasse42. 3D visualization servis. Terodesign studio:*!2(())<iframe class=\"ku-embed\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen allow=\"xr-spatial-tracking; gyroscope; accelerometer\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://kuula.co/share/7dqZx?fs=1&vr=0&gyro=0&autorotate=0.63&thumbs=0&alpha=0.60&hideinst=1&chromeless=0&logo=1\"></iframe>:*!:*!2'),(24,'Domodedovo Coffeeshop. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We received a request from Asthetiquegroup to provide a set of visualizations for a Coffeeshop in Domodedovo Airport, Moscow. The design of the coffee shop was created by Asthetiquegroup. The designer\'s goal was to achieve the maximum pleasant atmosphere ','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, coffee, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, restaurant, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Domodedovo Coffeeshop','<p>We received a request from Asthetiquegroup to provide a set of visualizations for a Coffeeshop in Domodedovo Airport, Moscow. The design of the coffee shop was created by Asthetiquegroup. The designer\'s goal was to achieve the maximum pleasant atmosphere of the coffee shop in order for the clients to experience the desire to taste a delicious cup of coffee and take a rest between the flights. This particular project intended to take part in a contest, which is why we had to create a visualization for a short period of time. Our task was to create the finest quality possible as the result of the contest depended on us as well. Join us for a cup of coffee there!</p>','<ul><li>Architects: Asthetique Group</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Moskow, Russia</li><li>Year: 2018</li></ul>','1600097767_389.jpg:*!Domodedovo Coffeeshop. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600097788_205.jpg:*!Domodedovo Coffeeshop. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600098021_746.jpg:*!Domodedovo Coffeeshop. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600098043_859.jpg:*!Domodedovo Coffeeshop. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600098079_215.jpg:*!Domodedovo Coffeeshop. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600098088_296.jpg:*!Domodedovo Coffeeshop. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4'),(25,'Adlershof. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We received a request to create visualizations for the office and research facility in Adlershof, Berlin. The building is situated in the middle of Technology Park - one of the most prominent science and technology centers in Europe. You may find modernly','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Adlershof','<p>We received a request to create visualizations for the office and research facility in Adlershof, Berlin. The building is situated in the middle of Technology Park - one of the most prominent science and technology centers in Europe. You may find modernly equipped offices, research, and manufacturing premises inside this building. Such kind of establishment often requires a lot of free space and we hope that you like the landscape design as well as architecture and lighting on these visualizations.</p>','<ul><li>Architecture: Fuchshuber Architekten</li><li>Client: Purerender</li><li>Visualization : Terodesign</li><li>Location: Karl-Ziegler-Str. 12489 Berlin Germany</li><li>Date: April 2018</li></ul>','1600098543_474.jpg:*!Adlershof. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600098533_281.jpg:*!Adlershof. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1'),(26,'Ibis hotel. Parndorf. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This particular project was ordered by Imogent GmbH. It is situated in Parndorf, Austria. We received a request to create several exterior visualizations for one of the Ibis hotels. The building is located near the shopping arcades with well-known brands.','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','IBIS Hotel. Parndorf','<p>This particular project was ordered by Imogent GmbH. It is situated in Parndorf, Austria. We received a request to create several exterior visualizations for one of the Ibis hotels. The building is located near the shopping arcades with well-known brands. It is common to have a shopping vacation trip to a place like this and spend a night there in order to fully satisfy your shopping needs. We admire the lighting on these pictures very much, as we think that dusk sunlight emphasizes the architecture in the best way.</p>','<ul><li>Client: Imogent GmbH</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign</li><li>Location: 7111 Parndorf, Austria</li><li>July 2019</li></ul>','1600099517_316.jpg:*!Ibis hotel. Parndorf. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600099526_257.jpg:*!Ibis hotel. Parndorf. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1'),(29,'Tibbaut. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Sometimes even minor things make us absolutely fall in love with the architecture, in the latest work of Raúl Sánchez we saw the excellency in shape and form and we wanted to give you our take on it in our renders. This work shows how combining just a few','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Tibbaut','<p>Sometimes even minor things make us absolutely fall in love with the architecture, in the latest work of Raúl Sánchez we saw the excellency in shape and form and we wanted to give you our take on it in our renders. This work shows how combining just a few colors can grow into marvelous architecture.</p>','<ul><li>Architects: Raúl Sánchez</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: El Raval, Barcelona, Spain</li><li>May 2018</li></ul>','1600105324_361.jpg:*!Tibbaut. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600105312_523.jpg:*!Tibbaut. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600105343_2.jpg:*!Tibbaut. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600105614_214.jpg:*!Tibbaut. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600105413_701.jpg:*!Tibbaut. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600105701_305.jpg:*!Tibbaut. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600105713_799.jpg:*!Tibbaut. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3'),(28,'Brown. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This project was designed by Asthetiquegroup. They created the interior and exterior design of the building and we had to create a set of visualizations with this design. This residential property is situated in Philadelphia P.A. The building is decorated','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Brown','<p>This project was designed by Asthetiquegroup. They created the interior and exterior design of the building and we had to create a set of visualizations with this design. This residential property is situated in Philadelphia P.A. The building is decorated with high-quality materials and luxurious furniture, which can be noticed from the first look at this design. Every feature of the building is perfectly emphasized with colors and lighting. We hope that you like this design as much as we do!</p>','<ul><li>Design: Asthetique Group</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: 1 Brown Street | Philadelphia P.A. 19123</li><li>February 2018</li></ul>','1600104805_709.jpg:*!Brown. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600104933_711.jpg:*!Brown. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600104951_260.jpg:*!Brown. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600104960_713.jpg:*!Brown. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600104992_211.jpg:*!Brown. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600105008_297.jpg:*!Brown. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600105035_213.jpg:*!Brown. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3'),(30,'Apartment365. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This particular project is a collaboration with Fonbureau from Moscow, Russia. Fonbureau created the design of the apartment and our task was to create a set of visualizations. This was an order from a private client and the style of the interior had to b','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Apartment-365','<p>This particular project is a collaboration with Fonbureau from Moscow, Russia. Fonbureau created the design of the apartment and our task was to create a set of visualizations. This was an order from a private client and the style of the interior had to be something between the minimalistic and loft. The main requirements for the design were to make it ergonomic, and yet spacious. The building is surrounded by parks and squares which can be perfectly seen from the apartments through large windows and from terraces.</p>','<ul><li>Design: Fonbureau</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Moskow, Russia</li><li>March 2018</li></ul>','1600106341_79.jpg:*!Apartment365. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600106379_304.jpg:*!Apartment365. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600106436_219.jpg:*!Apartment365. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600106458_295.jpg:*!Apartment365. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600106492_60.jpg:*!Apartment365. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600106507_899.jpg:*!Apartment365. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600106521_728.jpg:*!Apartment365. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3'),(31,'FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We were inspired by the project by ONG&ONG Pte Ltd and decided to base our next practice project on it. Our aim wasn\'t to recreate the reference accurately but to focus on the overall atmosphere and mood of the interior. We have gained invaluable lighting','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','FHM Bachelor','<p>We were inspired by the project by ONG&amp;ONG Pte Ltd and decided to base our next practice project on it. Our aim wasn\'t to recreate the reference accurately but to focus on the overall atmosphere and mood of the interior. We have gained invaluable lighting and post-processing experience from this project, that we can apply to our future commercial works. Our main goal is always improving our abilities to deliver the best possible results for our clients.</p>','<ul><li>Architects: ONG&amp;ONG Pte Ltd</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Bangkok, Thailand</li><li>March 2019</li></ul>','1600107020_61.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600107042_75.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600107062_151.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600107075_789.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600107087_195.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600107102_819.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600107137_145.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600107117_681.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600107168_865.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600107157_60.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600107175_383.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1601307851_87.mp4:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6(())1600107467_211.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6(())1600107497_131.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!7(())1600107545_826.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!7(())1600107525_273.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!8(())1600107536_425.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!8(())1600107686_929.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!9(())1600107696_292.jpg:*!FHM Bachelor. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!9'),(32,'Proti Proudu. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Do you like drinking coffee as much as we do? We start every morning with a cup of coffee. It is especially pleasant to start your day with a cup of coffee while sitting in the comfortable and cozy cafeteria. Even taking into account that in this particul','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, restaurant, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, coffee, concept, realestate, estate, property','Proti Proudu','<p>Do you like drinking coffee as much as we do? We start every morning with a cup of coffee. It is especially pleasant to start your day with a cup of coffee while sitting in the comfortable and cozy cafeteria. Even taking into account that in this particular interior the materials are mostly simple, yet they do give you a sense of required comfort. It was especially interesting for us to play with the lighting of this interior, as different kinds of lighting create a different mood.</p>','<ul><li>Architects: Mimosa architekti</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Březinova 471/22, Praha, Czech Republic</li><li>Oсtober 2018</li></ul>','1601306700_375.mp4:*!Proti Proudu. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1601306716_758.mp4:*!Proti Proudu. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1601306729_401.mp4:*!Proti Proudu. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())<div class=\"curtain curtain-h\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600338011_989.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600338016_151.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>:*!:*!2'),(33,'Fortune Plaza. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We got inspired by the Fortune Plaza project by P&T Group and decided to visualize it for practice purposes. We adhered to the smallest technical details and it was an incredible project to work on. Particularly, the shape of the building made the project','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Fortune Plaza','<p>We got inspired by the Fortune Plaza project by P&amp;T Group and decided to visualize it for practice purposes. We adhered to the smallest technical details and it was an incredible project to work on. Particularly, the shape of the building made the project quite challenging, but we were very satisfied after its completion.</p>','<ul><li>Architects: P&amp;T Group</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Beijing, China</li><li>Oсtober 2018</li></ul>','1600108547_129.jpg:*!Fortune Plaza. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600108564_206.jpg:*!Fortune Plaza. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600108588_755.jpg:*!Fortune Plaza. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600108616_88.jpg:*!Fortune Plaza. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600108626_434.jpg:*!Fortune Plaza. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2'),(34,'Sifera House. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','There are so many variables that can be present in a single place, day turns to night, warm colors turn cold, sometimes the mood of the picture is changed completely by those and many other factors. This project started when we saw the amazing work of arc','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, interior, cgi, render, rendering, design, cgartist, architecture, interiordesign, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Sifera House','<p>There are so many variables that can be present in a single place, day turns to night, warm colors turn cold, sometimes the mood of the picture is changed completely by those and many other factors. This project started when we saw the amazing work of architects Josep Camps and Olga Felip. We tried to show that the same things may appear in a new light, even if you look at them at the same angle. The world around changes and so does the perception of the renders.</p>','<ul><li>Architects: Josep Camps, Olga Felip</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Barcelona, Spain</li><li>April 2018</li></ul>','1601305366_513.mp4:*!Sifera House. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1601305381_182.mp4:*!Sifera House. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1601305395_57.mp4:*!Sifera House. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1601305408_702.jpg:*!Sifera House. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1601305428_595.mp4:*!Sifera House. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1601305443_989.mp4:*!Sifera House. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())<div class=\"curtain curtain-h\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600336129_708.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600336152_334.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>:*!:*!4(())<div class=\"curtain curtain-h\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600336090_649.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600336094_940.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>:*!:*!4(())<div class=\"curtain curtain-h\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600336172_717.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600336178_801.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>:*!:*!4'),(35,'Delta Tielt. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Colors are important instruments of the artist in architecture, it\'s a true mastery to show clean pallet without oversaturating the main concept. In our opinion architect Steven De Jaeghere managed to do just that with his DELTA project. It\'s very difficu','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Delta Tielt','<p>Colors are important instruments of the artist in architecture, it\'s a true mastery to show clean pallet without oversaturating the main concept. In our opinion architect Steven De Jaeghere managed to do just that with his DELTA project. It\'s very difficult to find the balance between simple and minimalistic design for it to look beautiful. We got inspired when we saw photos by Stijn Vereeken and decided to upgrade our skills on exterior visualizations by recreating this beautiful architecture in a form of 3D visualization.</p>','<ul><li>Architects: DE JAEGHERE Architectuuratelier</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: 8700, Belgium</li><li>May 2018</li></ul>','1601304946_285.mp4:*!Delta Tielt. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1601304963_416.mp4:*!Delta Tielt. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1601304976_624.mp4:*!Delta Tielt. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())<div class=\"curtain curtain-h\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600337786_480.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"/multimedia/1600337789_825.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>:*!:*!2'),(36,'Versluys','Inspiration can come from different sources, our came from the project by Govaert & Vanhoutte called Versluys. This project shows how the architect can transform a simple office block into something unusual and beautiful. We experimented a bit with the co','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, interior, cgi, render, rendering, design, cgartist, architecture, interiordesign, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Versluys','<p>Inspiration can come from different sources, our came from the project by Govaert &amp; Vanhoutte called Versluys. This project shows how the architect can transform a simple office block into something unusual and beautiful. We experimented a bit with the colors and time of the day, and we wanted to share our work with you. We love doing projects like this because they give us more creative freedom. We hope we managed to succeed, we let you be the judge of that.</p>','<ul><li>Architects: Govaert &amp; Vanhoutte Architects</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: 8400 Ostend, Belgium</li><li>December 2017</li></ul>','1600110805_493.jpg:*!Versluys. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600110816_256.jpg:*!Versluys. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600111049_150.jpg:*!Versluys. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600110900_892.jpg:*!Versluys. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600110984_247.jpg:*!Versluys. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2'),(37,'Christopher Street. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','This was an interesting project indeed. We were contacted by Asthetiquegroup to create a visualization for the reconstruction of one of the houses in New York. The new interior and exterior design were created by Asthetiquegroup. We tried to recreate the ','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, interior, cgi, render, rendering, design, cgartist, architecture, interiordesign, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Christopher Street','<p>This was an interesting project indeed. We were contacted by Asthetiquegroup to create a visualization for the reconstruction of one of the houses in New York. The new interior and exterior design were created by Asthetiquegroup. We tried to recreate the atmosphere of New York as much as possible within this project. We tried to select the best camera angles and lighting in order to give the viewers the most prominent feeling of urban New York streets together with a home cozy atmosphere.</p>','<ul><li>Design: Asthetique Group</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign Studio</li><li>Location: 22 Christopher Street, New York, USA</li><li>August 2017</li></ul>','1600111410_163.jpg:*!Christopher Street. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600111524_567.jpg:*!Christopher Street. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600111533_196.jpg:*!Christopher Street. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600111450_460.jpg:*!Christopher Street. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600111469_17.jpg:*!Christopher Street. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2'),(38,'The BLOX. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We couldn\'t help but get inspired by an incredible project by Prague architects Jan Holna and Petr Šedivý (http://www.dam.cz), so we decided to create a visualization for it. We, like all 3D artists, can always find time to improve our skills and learn ne','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, interior, cgi, render, rendering, design, cgartist, architecture, interiordesign, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','The BLOX','<p>We couldn\'t help but get inspired by an incredible project by Prague architects Jan Holna and Petr Šedivý (http://www.dam.cz), so we decided to create a visualization for it. We, like all 3D artists, can always find time to improve our skills and learn new techniques. It was very interesting for us to try new lighting methods and gain experience that we will use in our commercial projects. Beautiful minimalistic architectural forms and contrasting materials of the building make it stand out from the surroundings and attract attention. We invite architects who enjoy the quality of our work to collaborate on many interesting and satisfying projects.</p>','<ul><li>Architects: Jan Holna, Petr Šedivý (DAM.architekti)</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Prague, Czech Republic</li><li>November 2018</li></ul>','1600112243_163.jpg:*!The BLOX. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600112298_724.jpg:*!The BLOX. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600112201_63.jpg:*!The BLOX. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600112225_764.jpg:*!The BLOX. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600112346_351.jpg:*!The BLOX. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600112338_317.mp4:*!The BLOX. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3'),(39,'Office Building Kennedy-Wisconsin. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Our team decided to make a beautiful visualization based on photos by Marcos Mendizabal. We were inspired by the unusual design of the building and made sure to recreate it in accordance with the reference material as closely as possible. Our objective wa','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Office Building Kennedy-Wisconsin','<p>Our team decided to make a beautiful visualization based on photos by Marcos Mendizabal. We were inspired by the unusual design of the building and made sure to recreate it in accordance with the reference material as closely as possible. Our objective was to not exactly replicate the surrounding environment but to bring some of our own ideas and creativity into the visualization process. We create projects like this for our enjoyment and, of course, experience, which we then can apply to our commercial projects.</p>','<ul><li>Architects: Alemparte-Morelli y Asociados Arquitectos</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Vitacura, RM, Chile</li><li>Oсtober 2018</li></ul>','1600113023_926.jpg:*!Office Building Kennedy-Wisconsin. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600112886_309.jpg:*!Office Building Kennedy-Wisconsin. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600113004_178.jpg:*!Office Building Kennedy-Wisconsin. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1601304776_836.mp4:*!Office Building Kennedy-Wisconsin. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600112804_439.jpg:*!Office Building Kennedy-Wisconsin. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2'),(40,'Scandinavian. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','In this project, we wanted to create something that will combine the architectural style of Scandinavia with its beautiful nature. We gathered the info on the region and experimented with the colors and atmosphere to make it look as real as possible. Insp','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Scandinavian','<p>In this project, we wanted to create something that will combine the architectural style of Scandinavia with its beautiful nature. We gathered the info on the region and experimented with the colors and atmosphere to make it look as real as possible. Inspiration is a hard thing to come by, but we managed to find it with this project.</p>','<ul><li>Noncommercial</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>March 2017</li></ul>','1600113811_646.mp4:*!Scandinavian. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600113748_4.mp4:*!Scandinavian. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2'),(41,'Kobylanka. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We received a request to create a set of exterior visualizations for a house in Kobylanka, Poland. The design for this house was created by Anna Thurow. Kobylanka is a small town in the south of Poland which is situated near Krakow. While working on this ','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Kobylanka','<p>We received a request to create a set of exterior visualizations for a house in Kobylanka, Poland. The design for this house was created by Anna Thurow. Kobylanka is a small town in the south of Poland which is situated near Krakow. While working on this project we wanted to convey the Polish atmosphere of a cozy home in combination with the wonderful minimalistic architecture created by the designer and we hope that we managed to do so.</p>','<ul><li>Architecture: Anna Thurow</li><li>Location: Kobylanka, Poland</li><li>April 2018</li></ul>','1600114410_750.jpg:*!Kobylanka. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600114360_56.jpg:*!Kobylanka. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600114391_39.jpg:*!Kobylanka. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600114447_452.jpg:*!Kobylanka. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600114430_815.jpg:*!Kobylanka. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2'),(42,'Melbourne Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We were contacted by one of our private clients to create a design and a set of visualizations for a villa in Melbourne, Australia. The client wanted to create a minimalistic design with a neutral color palette, and yet comfortable and functional. The whi','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Melbourne Villa','<p>We were contacted by one of our private clients to create a design and a set of visualizations for a villa in Melbourne, Australia. The client wanted to create a minimalistic design with a neutral color palette, and yet comfortable and functional. The white color of the interior works perfectly for visual enlarging the space. The furniture and materials that are used in this design give the required fealing of comfort and coziness. We hope that this design will not leave you indifferent!</p>','<ul><li>Private client</li><li>Design: Terodesign</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign</li><li>Location: Melbourne, Australia</li><li>Date: July 2017</li></ul>','1600114876_732.jpg:*!Melbourne Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600114905_216.jpg:*!Melbourne Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600114896_685.jpg:*!Melbourne Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600114936_274.jpg:*!Melbourne Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600114923_976.jpg:*!Melbourne Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600114973_877.jpg:*!Melbourne Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600114981_828.jpg:*!Melbourne Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600115459_263.jpg:*!Melbourne Villa. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3'),(43,'Apartamento en Malaga. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We received a request from a private client to create a set of interior visualizations for the apartment in Malaga, Spain. We had to create the design as well as visualizations. The requirements for the design were simple - it has to be minimalistic, ergo','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Apartamento en Malaga','<p>We received a request from a private client to create a set of interior visualizations for the apartment in Malaga, Spain. We had to create the design as well as visualizations. The requirements for the design were simple - it has to be minimalistic, ergonomic, and yet functional and cozy. We did our best to make the client happy with the result. We hope that you like this minimalistic design as much as we do!</p>','<ul><li>Private client</li><li>Design by Terodesign</li><li>Location: Málaga, Spain</li><li>Date: July 2017</li></ul>','1600115765_964.jpg:*!Apartamento en Malaga. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600115779_909.jpg:*!Apartamento en Malaga. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600115788_432.jpg:*!Apartamento en Malaga. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600115797_691.jpg:*!Apartamento en Malaga. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600115809_513.jpg:*!Apartamento en Malaga. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600115819_198.jpg:*!Apartamento en Malaga. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2'),(44,'Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We were contacted by a famous polish studio called Tamizo to create a set of interior visualizations. Our task within this project was to convey a minimalistic mood, to emphasize colors and luxurious materials. Furthermore, we also had to select the requi','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Olsztyn','<p>We were contacted by a famous polish studio called Tamizo to create a set of interior visualizations. Our task within this project was to convey a minimalistic mood, to emphasize colors and luxurious materials. Furthermore, we also had to select the required decorations and the best camera angles in order to show all the beautiful design solutions of the house. The client was satisfied with the result, so as we were. We decided to create several more additional camera angles because we enjoyed working on this project very much.</p>','<ul><li>Design: Tamizo studio</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Poland, Olsztyn</li><li>August 2016</li></ul>','1600116123_613.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600116137_291.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600116374_257.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600116363_5.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600116274_54.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600116201_339.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600116214_607.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600116506_438.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600116450_902.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600116614_990.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600116910_820.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!5(())1600116920_476.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!5(())1600116928_417.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!5(())1600116867_313.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6(())1600116856_533.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6(())1600116845_275.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6(())1600116961_884.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!7(())1600117143_670.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!7(())1600117181_786.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!8(())1600117171_544.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!8(())1600117006_56.jpg:*!Olsztyn. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!8'),(45,'Horkogo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We created this set of interior visualizations of the apartment from Kyiv, Ukraine. Besides the visualizations, we also took part in creating the design of this project together with Leks architects. The main task within this project was to preserve the o','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Horkogo','<p>We created this set of interior visualizations of the apartment from Kyiv, Ukraine. Besides the visualizations, we also took part in creating the design of this project together with Leks architects. The main task within this project was to preserve the original classic interior style, make it comfortable and cozy, and yet, to add some modern furniture elements. However, we faced a lot of difficulties here because this is an old building and a lot of elements had to be preserved in an original appearance. For example, we had to model the fireplace from the photographs. Nevertheless, it was a very interesting and challenging project and we hope that you like the result!</p>','<ul><li>Private client</li><li>Design: Leks architects &amp; Terodesign</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign</li><li>Location: Hor\'kogo str. Kyiv, Ukraine</li><li>August 2017</li></ul>','1600117727_417.jpg:*!Horkogo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600117718_979.jpg:*!Horkogo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600117748_999.jpg:*!Horkogo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600117760_454.jpg:*!Horkogo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600117769_135.jpg:*!Horkogo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600117777_620.jpg:*!Horkogo. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2'),(46,'Xi\'an Westin Museum Hotel. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','We got inspired by the work of Chinese architects Neri&Hu. Their style of mixing the new and old is astounding. Because of that, we wanted to create photorealistic visualizations of this project. We did the project in our spare time to polish our skills i','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, interior, cgi, render, rendering, design, cgartist, architecture, interiordesign, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Xi\'an Westin Museum Hotel','<p>We got inspired by the work of Chinese architects Neri&amp;Hu. Their style of mixing the new and old is astounding. Because of that, we wanted to create photorealistic visualizations of this project. We did the project in our spare time to polish our skills in this kind of visualization. We got so interested in the project that we really want to visit this building in the future.</p>','<ul><li>Architecture: Neri&amp;Hu architects</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Shaanxi, China</li><li>January 2018</li></ul>','1600340324_933.jpg:*!Xi\'an Westin Museum Hotel. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600340332_883.jpg:*!Xi\'an Westin Museum Hotel. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600340498_15.jpg:*!Xi\'an Westin Museum Hotel. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600340351_846.jpg:*!Xi\'an Westin Museum Hotel. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2'),(49,'Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','Since the beginning of our work in 2005, we have created a lot of images that we decided not to display as separate projects. Nevertheless, we like some of the images from older and more recent projects, which is why we decided to create this page (site, ','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, interior, cgi, render, rendering, design, cgartist, architecture, interiordesign, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Selection of projects','<p>Since the beginning of our work in 2005, we have created a lot of images that we decided not to display as separate projects. Nevertheless, we like some of the images from older and more recent projects, which is why we decided to create this page (site, webpage) with various images from multiple projects.</p>','<ul><li>Clients: Mesmetric, Volumevisual, PK AID, Postformula and other</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Year: 2005-2018</li></ul>','1600344696_859.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600344730_70.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600344953_4.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600344974_780.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600345002_66.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600345011_284.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600345027_311.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600345034_159.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600345053_959.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600345060_92.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600345066_655.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600345079_406.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!5(())1600345087_389.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!5(())1600345126_519.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6(())1600345119_121.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6(())1600345112_928.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6(())1600345189_223.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!7(())1600345195_560.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!7(())1600345202_898.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!7(())1600345154_888.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!8(())1600345162_274.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!8(())1600345177_140.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!8(())1600345250_711.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!9(())1600345264_584.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!9(())1600345277_604.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!10(())1600345284_854.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!10(())1600345306_81.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!10(())1600345321_819.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!11(())1600345328_741.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!11(())1600345351_954.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!11(())1600345464_799.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!12(())1600345476_703.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!12(())1600345627_528.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!12(())1600345377_186.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!13(())1600345387_264.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!13(())1600345408_791.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!13(())1600345418_432.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!14(())1600345426_925.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!14(())1600345433_607.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!14(())1600345747_996.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!15(())1600345754_887.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!15(())1600346033_460.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!16(())1600346042_648.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!16(())1600346049_565.jpg:*!Selection of projects. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!16'),(48,'Wichertstraße & Poschingerstrasse. 3D visailization service. Terodesign studio','Excitement & diversity: The northern Friedrichshain neighborhood around the Samariter district and the old slaughterhouse has experienced a remarkable revitalization in recent years. From squatted buildings, the area has now become one of the most popular','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, interior, design, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, interiordesign, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property','Wichertstraße. Poschingerstrasse. Templiner Park','<p>Excitement &amp; diversity:&nbsp;The northern Friedrichshain neighborhood around the Samariter district and the old slaughterhouse has experienced a remarkable revitalization in recent years. From squatted buildings, the area has now become one of the most popular neighborhoods for young families, students, and the creative scene. To the north, it borders the district of Prenzlauer Berg, and to the east Lichtenberg. Karl-Marx-Alle and Frankfurter Allee divide Friedrichshain into a north and a south neighborhood. With the TV tower in perfect view from Frankfurter Tor, one really feels at home in Berlin here.&nbsp;Friedrichshain seems to have a favorite café on offer for each of its residents. The neighborhood speaks a thousand languages, offers its international inhabitant\'s cuisines from all over the world, and is accordingly open as a result of its diversity. Here the young live side by side with the old, the newcomers next to the original Berliners, and all with a shared love for this colorful district.</p><p>Goal: 3 Great projects that we created in collaboration with Bewocon company. A set of interior renderings was made, in which we showed different interior designs of several luxurious apartments. Also, our task was to beneficially represent an expensive real estate in this residential complex. The time to complete this project wasn’t long, so we worked hard and are now ready to show you the result.</p>','<ul><li>Client: Bewocon Berliner Wohnbau Consult GMBH</li><li>Visualization: Terodesign studio</li><li>Location: Berlin, Germany</li><li>January 2019</li></ul>','1600342266_576.jpg:*!Wichertstraße. Poschingerstrasse. Templiner Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600342276_563.jpg:*!Wichertstraße. Poschingerstrasse. Templiner Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1600342290_524.jpg:*!Wichertstraße. Poschingerstrasse. Templiner Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600342302_621.jpg:*!Wichertstraße. Poschingerstrasse. Templiner Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1600342316_627.jpg:*!Wichertstraße. Poschingerstrasse. Templiner Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3(())1600342329_923.jpg:*!Wichertstraße. Poschingerstrasse. Templiner Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600342343_832.jpg:*!Wichertstraße. Poschingerstrasse. Templiner Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!4(())1600342356_570.jpg:*!Wichertstraße. Poschingerstrasse. Templiner Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!5(())1600342367_756.jpg:*!Wichertstraße. Poschingerstrasse. Templiner Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!5(())1600342462_480.jpg:*!Wichertstraße. Poschingerstrasse. Templiner Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6(())1600342475_859.jpg:*!Wichertstraße. Poschingerstrasse. Templiner Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6(())1600342484_484.jpg:*!Wichertstraße. Poschingerstrasse. Templiner Park. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!6'),(50,'Victoria Street. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio','','3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, cg, cgi, render, rendering, designer, cgartist, architecture, 3dsmax, concept, realestate, estate, property, propertydevelopment','Victoria Street','<p>Let us kindly introduce another project that we created for the Arctic Mirage studio in January 2019. This particular building is situated in Victoria state in Australia. Our task within this project was to create a set of visualizations for selling the property. Being inspired by the architecture made by FATT!STUDIO, we decided to dream up a bit over this project and update the pictures and now we are ready to present the result to you. You can see how different lighting can create a different atmosphere and make the facade look dreamlike. We hope that this project will give you unforgettable emotions!</p>','<ul><li>Client: Arctic Mirage studio</li><li>3D visualization: Terodesign</li><li data-empty=\"true\">Location: 21 Victoria St, Footscray VIC 3011, Australia</li><li data-empty=\"true\">January 2019</li></ul>','1601293691_532.jpg:*!Victoria Street. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!1(())1601294029_845.jpg:*!Victoria Street. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1601293990_525.mp4:*!Victoria Street. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!2(())1601295406_71.jpg:*!Victoria Street. 3D visualization service. Terodesign studio:*!3');
