INSERT INTO `tbl_team` VALUES ('employee:*!1600776039_512.jpg:*!:*!1:*!Vitalii:*!CCO, Co-Founder, Project Manager:*!Vitalii is the connecting link between the client and the team, represents the interests of the studio, and makes sure that everything goes on time and within the scope of the project. He is the first person you will communicate with, and the one who will be with you during the whole working process.(())employee:*!1602668399_299.jpg:*!:*!1:*!Dmitriy:*!CCO, Co-Founder, Project Manager:*!Dmitriy is the project manager for the project coming from the German, Swiss, or Austrian market.  The main responsibility is to support the projects’ workflow and ongoing processes, be the first person between our creators and the customer, create a positive client’s experience.(())employee:*!1602668321_247.jpg:*!:*!1:*!Dmitry:*!Co-Founder, Art Director, 3D artist:*!Dmitriy is the CEO and Art Director of Terodesign Studio. With 15 years of experience in creating architectural visualizations and running the studio, he can evaluate and spot every detail of the project and suggest optimal and reasonable solutions. Each and every project carefully goes through with his thoughtful guidance.(())img:*!1602668807_550.jpg:*!:*!2:*!:*!:*!(())employee:*!1602668518_140.jpg:*!:*!2:*!:*!:*!(())img:*!1602668834_740.jpg:*!:*!3:*!:*!:*!(())employee:*!1602668563_674.jpg:*!:*!3:*!Bogdan:*!3D artist:*!Every architectural visualization project cannot be made without filling the scene with different objects. Bogdan is a qualified 3d artist who is proficient at working with drawings and models. He created dozens of buildings and thousands of objects, so there is no doubt that Bogdan will be able to recreate your architecture with incredible accuracy.(())employee:*!1602668621_836.jpg:*!:*!3:*!Alexandr:*!3D artist:*!When it comes to lighting, texturing, and working within the main visualization process - Aleksandr is the one who takes care of these steps. His professionalism is clearly visible in our visualizations. Whether it is working with exteriors or interiors - Aleksandr shows himself in the best way in any visualization field.(())employee:*!1600776228_117.jpg:*!:*!4:*!Yevheniia:*!CFO:*!Yevheniia is the keeper of the funds and all Terodesign financial assets. She is responsible for all the financial operations of our studio. Nobody can do better at accounting than she does.(())employee:*!1600497124_4.jpg:*!:*!4:*!Ivan:*!Photographer:*!Ivan is the master of photography and working with the perspective. He goes to different locations in order to make some photographs of the surrounding area or to make wonderful background images that will be used in our visualizations.(())employee:*!1600776147_206.jpg:*!:*!4:*!Oleksandr:*!Animator, 3D Artist:*!Oleksandr takes the relay when it is necessary to work on animation projects. He works mostly with video production and animation. If you want to create video materials then he is definitely the one who will make your projects come alive.(())img:*!1600776604_557.jpg:*!:*!5:*!:*!:*!(())img:*!1600776617_234.jpg:*!:*!5:*!:*!:*!(())img:*!1600776631_946.jpg:*!:*!5:*!:*!:*!');
